<title>USA: Aerial Communications signs distribution pacts.</title>
<headline>Aerial Communications signs distribution pacts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aerial Communications Inc said it signed handset distribution agreements with six major retail chains.</p>
<p>The chains are Best Buy Co Inc, Circuit City Stores Inc, Office Depot Inc, OfficeMax Inc, Tandy Corp's Radio Shack and Staples Inc.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, the retailers will stock and sell phones for Aerial's personal communications services in nearly 260 retail locations in six markets, Aerial said.</p>
<p>&quot;The retail partners we've joined with thus far enjoy a strong presence in each of our markets, and will help extend our reach in the wireless marketplace,&quot; Gerald Rhodes, Aerial's vice president of sales and marketing, said in a statement.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
